  "flows": [
    {
      "id": "order-flow",
      "title": "How an order flows from the cart to shipping",
      "entry": "service:frontend",
      "steps": [
        "service:frontend",
        "service:checkout",
        "service:cart",
        "service:product-catalog",
        "service:currency",
        "service:payment",
        "service:shipping",
        "service:email",
        "service:kafka",
        "service:accounting",
        "service:fraud-detection"
      ],
      "anchors": [
        {
          "path": "src/checkout/main.go",
          "contains": "func (cs *checkout) PlaceOrder("
        },
        {
          "path": "src/checkout/main.go",
          "contains": "/send_order_confirmation"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/checkout/kafka/producer.go",
          "contains": "return \"orders\""
        }
      ],
      "notes": "Read from checkout PlaceOrder: get the cart, price items in the catalog, convert currency, charge payment, ship, send the confirmation email, publish to the orders topic, which accounting and fraud-detection consume."
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "task-01-checkout-placeorder",
      "title": "Modify the Go gRPC handler in checkout (PlaceOrder)",
      "scenario": "Scenario 6: Endpoint Change Pre-Context",
      "target_id": "service:checkout",
      "depth": 1,
      "tier": "contracts",
      "ground_truth": {
        "expected_upstream_services": [
          "service:cart",
          "service:currency",
          "service:email",
          "service:kafka",
          "service:payment",
          "service:product-catalog",
          "service:shipping"
        ],
        "expected_downstream_services": [
          "service:accounting",
          "service:fraud-detection",
          "service:frontend"
        ],
        "expected_affected_contracts": [
          "contract:CartService",
          "contract:CheckoutService",
          "contract:CurrencyService",
          "contract:PaymentService",
          "contract:ProductCatalogService",
          "contract:kafka:orders"
        ],
        "anchors": [
          {
            "path": "src/checkout/main.go",
            "contains": "pb.NewCartServiceClient"
          },
          {
            "path": "src/checkout/main.go",
            "contains": "/send_order_confirmation"
          },
          {
            "path": "src/checkout/kafka/producer.go",
            "contains": "return \"orders\""
          }
        ],
        "notes": "EmailService and ShippingService gRPC clients are constructed but never invoked; email and shipping are called over HTTP POST. Listing those proto contracts as affected is a false positive (the task-09/10 trap)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "task-02-frontend-cart-http",
      "title": "Modify the frontend HTTP /cart handler",
      "scenario": "Scenario 6: Endpoint Change Pre-Context",
      "target_id": "service:frontend",
      "depth": 1,
      "tier": "contracts",
      "ground_truth": {
        "expected_upstream_services": [
          "service:ad",
          "service:cart",
          "service:checkout",
          "service:currency",
          "service:product-catalog",
          "service:recommendation",
          "service:shipping"
        ],
        "expected_downstream_services": [
          "service:agent",
          "service:frontend-proxy",
          "service:mcp"
        ],
        "expected_affected_contracts": [
          "contract:AdService",
          "contract:CartService",
          "contract:CheckoutService",
          "contract:CurrencyService",
          "contract:ProductCatalogService",
          "contract:RecommendationService"
        ],
        "anchors": [
          {
            "path": "src/frontend/gateways/rpc/Cart.gateway.ts",
            "contains": "new CartServiceClient(CART_ADDR"
          },
          {
            "path": "compose.yaml",
            "contains": "- RECOMMENDATION_ADDR"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "quote and image-provider appear only in frontend's compose depends_on (start ordering); frontend never calls them. agent and mcp both run src/shared/tools.py, which calls the frontend /api routes over HTTP (APPLICATION_ENDPOINT=frontend:8080); both exist only in the agent profile."
      }
    },
