        "notes": "The core compose.yaml has no agent, mcp or chatbot; compose.agent.yaml adds them. agent calls the frontend over HTTP (src/shared/tools.py, APPLICATION_ENDPOINT); its depends_on on product-catalog is start ordering only. mcp is reached when MCP_ENABLED=True (env-gated, counted like checkout's KAFKA_ADDR path); chatbot posts prompts to agent."
